            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Keller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Didn't use the papaya and I used a variety of peppers. This was pretty good. But only try it if you like it spicy!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jason Hather"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This fails as a 'hot' sauce. UNLESS you have a sensitive palate...\n3 med-hot peppers to what amounts to at least 3 POUNDS of filler (onion, garlic, mango, etc) would severely reduce the heat.\n\nBut if you merely dice everything, and toss in a bowl, you've got an excellent salsa-style topping.",
            "datePublished": "2014-10-21T19:43:14.083Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "skygurlie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added more yellow/red/chili peppers.I added scallions and hit it with the juice of a lime.No sugar added. if you simmer the sauce long enough the sweetness of the peppers are released.",
            "datePublished": "2010-11-29T15:56:25.150Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Angela Dayle Windley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was just OK. Followed the recipe exactly. Was far far far too sweet for my taste &amp; not very spicy at all. Was expecting - hoping for - a fiery sauce. Very disappointing. It was ok, but more a thick sweet and sour taste than anything else. The smell of vinegar while it was cooking was overwhelming.",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-29T19:13:35.830Z"
          }
